     1	#!/usr/bin/env python3
     2	"""Run a bounded text task through DeepSeek Flash or a Jev judgment.
     3	
     4	Inputs are explicit files. Each request uses an independent session and sends
     5	only the supplied material. Costs are reserved in a local SQLite ledger.
     6	"""
     7	
